om ancient China, with a graceful figure, delicate facial features, and cascading black hair, dressed in lavish traditional attire. Her robe is primarily in dark purple hues, adorned with exquisite jewelry accents, jade bracelets on her wrists, and swaying tassels. Her eyes are filled with emotion, her movements light and elegant, her dance posture enchanting.  \n\nScene (Scene Description): The background features a romantic sea of roses, with petals dancing in the wind and a faint floral fragrance lingering in the air. The ground is covered with finely decorated classical patterns, creating a layered environment that evokes a tranquil and dreamy atmosphere.  \n\nMotion Description: The woman slowly twirls, her sleeves and skirt fluttering gracefully with each movement. Her motions are fluid and rhythmic, as if she were a celestial maiden descending to earth. The flowing of her skirt resembles rippling water, presenting a soft and elegant dynamic beauty in the scene.  \n\nAesthetic Control: Soft warm light bathes the subject, highlighting the intricate textures of her attire and the luster of her jewelry. The background is suffused with dreamy purple and rose-gold hues. The camera employs medium shots and slow push-in techniques, crafting an immersive visual experience.  \n\nStylization: The style is classical Eastern elegance, with finely detailed and realistic textures, infused with a romantic cinematic quality. The overall composition is poetic and brimming with classical charm."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 164, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 82, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [172], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["缓慢地移动镜头，从腰间逐渐推向眼尾，捕捉眼球转动与唇线绷紧的瞬间 + 一位剑客，锐利的眼眸先直视前方后扫向右侧，薄唇紧抿后勾起冷弧，耳尖微微泛红，刀鞘的反光掠过脸颊 + 廊